		"posts": [
			{
				"id": "post-leave-it-overnight",
				"slug": "leave-it-overnight",
				"status": "published",
				"data": {
					"title": "Leave It Overnight",
					"excerpt": "Almost every page reads better the next morning. A case for the slowest tool in publishing: a night's sleep.",
					"featured_image": {
						"$media": {
							"url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505142468610-359e7d316be0?w=1200&h=800&fit=crop",
							"alt": "A wave breaking on pale sand, seen from above",
							"filename": "leave-it-overnight.jpg"
						}
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b0",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b0s0",
									"text": "The most useful thing we do to a page before it goes out costs nothing and takes eight hours. We stop, close the laptop, and look at it again tomorrow.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b1",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b1s0",
									"text": "It sounds like putting things off. It is the opposite. A draft finished at six in the evening is read by the person who wrote it, who knows what every sentence was meant to say. The same draft at nine the next morning is read by a stranger, who only knows what it says.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b2",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b2s0",
									"text": "What the morning finds",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b3",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b3s0",
									"text": "The first paragraph is usually throat-clearing, and can go. One sentence is trying to do three jobs. A link points at the wrong page. None of this was visible the night before, because the writer was still inside the piece.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b4",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b4s0",
									"text": "The tide does the same work on a beach: it goes out, comes back, and the marks that did not matter are gone. What is left is the shape.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b5",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b5s0",
									"text": "Making room for it",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b6",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b6s0",
									"text": "The only cost is in the calendar. If something is due on Thursday, it is written by Wednesday. That is the whole method, and it has saved us from more mistakes than any checklist.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				"taxonomies": {
					"category": [
						"notes"
					],
					"tag": [
						"process"
					]
				},
				"bylines": [
					{
						"byline": "byline-guest",
						"roleLabel": "Guest note"
					}
				]
			},
			{
				"id": "post-a-small-set-of-parts",
				"slug": "a-small-set-of-parts",
				"status": "published",
				"data": {
					"title": "A Small Set of Parts",
					"excerpt": "A site built from six pieces you understand is easier to change than one built from sixty clever ones. How we chose ours.",
					"featured_image": {
						"$media": {
							"url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?w=1200&h=800&fit=crop",
							"alt": "A library of interface components open on a desktop monitor, with houseplants in front",
							"filename": "a-small-set-of-parts.jpg"
						}
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b0",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b0s0",
									"text": "Every site we have enjoyed looking after had the same quality: you could list its parts on one sheet of paper. A heading, a paragraph, a picture with a caption, a quote, a list, a link to the next thing.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b1",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b1s0",
									"text": "Every site we have dreaded opening had a part for each occasion. A special banner for the spring sale. Three kinds of card that differ by four pixels. Nobody remembers which is which, so each new page gets a new one.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b2",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b2s0",
									"text": "Choosing the six",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b3",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b3s0",
									"text": "We start from the writing, not from a library. Take the five most important pages, print them, and circle everything that is not plain text. Whatever is circled more than twice is a part. Whatever is circled once is a temptation.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b4",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b4s0",
									"text": "One way to show a picture, with room for a caption.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b5",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b5s0",
									"text": "One way to quote somebody.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b6",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b6s0",
									"text": "One way to point at the next thing to read.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b7",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b7s0",
									"text": "Nothing that only one page needs.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b8",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b8s0",
									"text": "What it buys",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b9",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b9s0",
									"text": "A new page takes an afternoon instead of a week, because there is nothing to design. A change to how quotes look happens once, everywhere. And a new person can learn the whole site before lunch.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				"taxonomies": {
					"category": [
						"tutorials"
					],
					"tag": [
						"tools"
					]
				},
				"bylines": [
					{
						"byline": "byline-demo-editor"
					}
				]
			},
			{
				"id": "post-measure-twice-publish-once",
				"slug": "measure-twice-publish-once",
				"status": "published",
				"data": {
					"title": "Measure Twice, Publish Once",
					"excerpt": "A machinist checks the work before the cut, not after. Here are the five checks we make before anything goes live.",
					"featured_image": {
						"$media": {
							"url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=1200&h=800&fit=crop",
							"alt": "A craftsman checking his work at a machine in a workshop",
							"filename": "measure-twice-publish-once.jpg"
						}
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b0",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b0s0",
									"text": "In a workshop, nobody finds out a part is wrong by shipping it. The check comes before the cut, it takes a minute, and it is the same check every time. Publishing deserves the same habit.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b1",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b1s0",
									"text": "The five checks",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b2",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b2s0",
									"text": "Read it aloud, once, from start to finish. The ear catches what the eye forgives.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b3",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b3s0",
									"text": "Follow every link, including the ones that were certainly right yesterday.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b4",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b4s0",
									"text": "Look at it on a phone, in daylight.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b5",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b5s0",
									"text": "Read the title and the first sentence on their own. For most readers, that is the whole piece.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b6",
							"style": "normal",
							"listItem": "bullet",
							"level": 1,
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b6s0",
									"text": "Ask what a stranger would search for to find it, and make sure those words are on the page.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b7",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b7s0",
									"text": "Why a list",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b8",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b8s0",
									"text": "None of this is clever, and that is the point. A list frees you from having to remember, on a busy afternoon, the one thing you only forget on busy afternoons.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b9",
							"style": "blockquote",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b9s0",
									"text": "The check is short because it is always the same.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "b10",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "b10s0",
									"text": "Ours is taped to the wall. It has saved us more often than we would like to admit.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				"taxonomies": {
					"category": [
						"checklists"
					],
